  <item>
    <title>EP.08 一块Keep 奖牌的诞生：聊聊奖牌背后的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f4b266e490c5dee53e4fe6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f4b266e490c5dee53e4fe6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大维：Keep 奖牌元老设计师，扭蛋狂人，热爱收藏潮玩（小红书：Daway的奇怪玩）</span></p><span></span><p><span>朱老师：Keep 奖牌资深运营，花样脑洞选手，业余占星师，奖牌创意玩法专家</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Ivy：被用户反向种草的奖牌新手</span></p><span></span><p><span>大紫：毛绒奖牌爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">00:04:48</a> 两位老师与Keep 奖牌的结缘：一个是半路出家，一个经历了全过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">00:08:14</a> 运营和设计的分歧点：吵架拌嘴太正常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">00:16:32</a> 奖牌的“可爱”风也有变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">00:18:54</a> 加注了汗水和时间，荣誉变成了用心的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">00:21:00</a> 加一点生活仪式感，添一点日常小浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">00:25:28</a> 喝奶茶时获得的灵感，让小新一家人在奖牌上立了起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">00:25:58</a> 运营和设计师常常为爱发电，“做IP绝对是带着爱的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">00:33:08</a> 早期的艺术家系列：李白奖牌把国风设计做到极致</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">00:39:19</a> 朱老师亲自画的线稿，竟把潮酷感IP画出了民族风？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">00:41:05</a> 没有一个创意会被浪费！民族风有了它的用武之地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">00:44:17</a> 机械风的七夕奖牌，暗藏7处心动元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">00:47:34</a> 尝试创新造型和工艺，无奈成本太高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3218">00:53:38</a> 毛绒奖牌让设计师的心情仿佛像坐过山车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3530">00:58:50</a> 当柯南遇上奖牌，那就来三场迷局解密挑战赛吧（竟然还有彩蛋页）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3676">01:01:16</a> “卷”在我们这儿绝对不是一个贬义词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3858">01:04:18</a> 运营哥哥和设计师哥哥的日常CP：各有各的火花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3905">01:05:05</a> 别把运动想的太沉重，大可从喜欢的奖牌开始慢慢跑起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4207">01:10:07</a> 希望未来用户亲手体验和参与奖牌制作过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4430">01:13:50</a> 奖牌还没有真正地出圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4530">01:15:30</a> 最近值得跑的奖牌：坚韧之贝、中国女孩·鹤、蜡笔小新最新场</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上就是本期全部内容，我们下期见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留言，说说你和Keep 奖牌之间的故事～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期剪辑：LE</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>福山雅治 - REDBLUE</span></p><span></span><p><span>Polo &amp; Pan - Feel Good</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本期所有观点仅代表嘉宾个人、如有侵权可联系删减</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmGV8RCzjMyPvCpje411Afr4CIxf.m4a" length="112463781" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z2OGVKenRpRUxvZUFLcHJxa0c4T0VkTTV1SEQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.07对话赵依侬｜运动中要花多少钱才能拥有又酷又自由的人生？极致干货</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64def2ff3fa4090b749521e4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64def2ff3fa4090b749521e4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Aug 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：依侬</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：大紫 Ivy 塔克 帝豪</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期剪辑：LE</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>运动是快乐的，那快乐的运动一定要花钱么？花多少钱才会获得无负担的运动体验？有哪些运动好物是值得付费的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>带着这些问题我们邀请到了本期嘉宾赵依侬和我们新同事帝豪，以消费为切口竟意外收获有关自我、身体和运动的深度讨论，金句频出、笑声不断，希望你也听的开心～</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制开始前，向主播们收集了「如果有 5 毛、 2 元……没有上限，你会买的运动好物是啥」，答案贴在下方。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你有哪些特别好的答案，欢迎评论区分享～</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgZyLaLiQAs0nWmVH-g9w70RKvFp.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft2qIOQyAfRlWzeSUpy4srGVgaUR.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> &nbsp;五位主播的运动消费观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> &nbsp;五毛钱能买啥？牛羊配是歪打正着的好物？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> &nbsp;年少不知公园好，那才是离我们最近的城市绿洲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> &nbsp;两块钱就能拥有的运动「游乐场」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a> &nbsp;不敢进健身房？怎么迈过耻感这道坎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> &nbsp;买笔、擦地……离谱却有效的运动，这都算 Keep？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>爱上短发，无性别人生又酷又自由</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 从</span><strong><span>「自律给我自由」到「自律给了我们快乐的自由」，原来是这么回事！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> 30 元- 200 元严选好物区，买就对了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2451">40:51</a> 健身房穿搭，从「选战袍」到「我穿衣服」</span><strong><span>（不听会后悔的自带反光板穿搭）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2848">47:28</a> 遛狗当运动，这靠谱么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a> 1500 元档的竞争激烈区！必听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">57:45</a> 运动向内、旅行向外，运动+旅行塑造了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3864">01:04:24</a> 当预算没有上限，有人要买学校，有人买全套，也有人买了自由</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上就是本期全部内容，我们下期见！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>福山雅治 - REDBLUE</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pogo - Data &amp; Picard</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本期所有观点仅代表嘉宾个人、如有侵权可联系删减</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr7KSKTulxcE-NRHp_jLZD0DWRGn.m4a" length="116241802" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZxNUhNWGl2YmdVZHFtZWwyUlNJSHRoU1RZS3cucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.06 立flag是命还是病？如何逃脱立了就倒的魔咒</title>
