    <guid isPermaLink="false">64b12a965680f4d4a8c948e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jul 2023 10:59:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年立个运动flag是很多人的必备仪式，</span></p><span></span><p><span>站在年中，回望年初，</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起聊聊flag倒掉的原因与如何做到有效的目标管理，</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>让我们开启「心想-身动-事成」的下半年！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> &nbsp;flag半年回顾，没完成才是常态？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a> &nbsp;flag大悟一：原来我们一直没分清flag与目标！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> &nbsp;flag大悟二：flag为何这么容易倒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> &nbsp;flag大悟三：允许一些完不成的flag存在，也是一件幸福的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> &nbsp;Ivy如何做到有效的目标管理，技能分享～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> &nbsp;意志力的局限性与</span><strong><span> 运动「扶旗」宝藏工具大公开</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：大紫 Ivy 塔克</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期剪辑：LE</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上就是本期全部内容，我们下期见！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>福山雅治 - REDBLUE</span></p><span></span><p><span>洪启,马条,杨沁松 - 我想，我想</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本期所有观点仅代表嘉宾个人、如有侵权可联系删减</span></p>]]></description>
